usage: safal_cli.py [-h] {prepare,train,demo,evaluate,predict} ...

Train, evaluate and apply the complete independent SAFAL research model. Only
normal training images fit target support/cutoffs. Native test labels and
masks are opened after prediction, solely for descriptive evaluation. Optional
error probabilities are fitted on source normal/CutPaste proxy events; their
transfer to industrial defects is an empirical question, not a guarantee.

positional arguments:
  {prepare,train,demo,evaluate,predict}
    prepare             Download pinned source and checksum-verified
                        pretrained weights

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
